[38;2;124;124;124mcomplex structure, which gives a canonical orientation).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mR and S are homeomorphic closed Riemann surfaces with genus g. The question is [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mwhether there always exists an orientation-preserving homeomorphism h: R → S.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mKey facts:[0m
